Comment: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:44.98,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.07,Default,,0,0,150,,Coming up on {\i1}Punirunes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, pet it, take care of it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's play, Punirunes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The show is squishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Punirunes. Before we knew it, these creatures\Nbegan to inhabit the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're squishsterious and soft to the touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They all love to be squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they're kachi-freezy and hard too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,These are some merry, adorable puni-pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, there could be\Na Punirune right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Airune Becomes a Babyrune{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're looking at pictures\Nfrom when Yuka was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so squishy back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Very squishy indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a hard time...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember Yuka's first word?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I forget? It was "mommy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.93,0:01:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wasn't it "daddy?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.43,0:01:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it was "mommy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.77,0:01:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It was "daddy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.69,0:01:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. "Mommy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"Daddy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.02,0:01:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Not "daddy," "mommy!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.15,0:01:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I want to squish a baby too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}This little one is Angelrune.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Its arrows bring luck to those they hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.34,0:01:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But its aim isn't very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:01:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Airune turned into a Babyrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the squishiness of a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}so{\i0} squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni-puni-puni-puni...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.22,0:02:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.06,0:02:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. You're hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That calls for...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's get squ-ooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.28,0:02:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it some of the\Nsquishsterious squishence...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:03:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stir it up, knead it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a squishy kneading\Nso it'll be nice and fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Appuni pie, ready to serve!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.52,0:03:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that it's had its meal...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.28,0:03:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see! You need the potty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.82,0:03:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Airune!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you're feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if its poop is squishy too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Y-Yuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You didn't seem kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so brave going\Nto the potty by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.83,0:04:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Redrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Punirunes grow when they're cared for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Redrune's squishiness is just perfect too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuka, come look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't, I'm busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I baked a really cool bread! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A really cool bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune, wait here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune, I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Punirunes melt when they're lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune? Airune!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune, I won't let you feel lonely again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, Airune!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Punirunes go to sleep at 8:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.35,0:06:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go to school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want you to feel lonely!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.69,0:06:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one who\Nwants to take care of Airune.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here for it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:37.17,Alt,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:39.00,Alt,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:40.84,Alt,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:43.01,Alt,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:44.63,Alt,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.63,0:06:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:46.34,Alt,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:48.01,Alt,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:49.35,Alt,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:50.64,Alt,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-puni!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since Yuka's desk is dirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they're cleaning it up by collecting dust\Nwith their squishy bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you cleaned up! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all dirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's give you a bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fun bathing you all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You burned up! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even squishier when you're clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.37,0:08:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.29,0:08:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it! This is Airune's squishiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was so fun squishing you\Nas a Babyrune too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Angelrune?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But Angelrune's a bit different today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The plan: the more, the likelier!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-Pal Files!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll tell you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Coolrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.91,0:09:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Coolrune is cool and stylish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:09:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a great dancer too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When everyone's in trouble,\Nit comes up with ideas and helps out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's one more thing Coolrune is good at!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the Puni-Pal Squestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,432.67)}1. Cooking
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.56,0:10:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,704.67)}2. Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.73,0:10:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,968.66)}3. Sitting
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.95,0:10:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,2. Cleaning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It loves keeping tidy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune, what'cha laughing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're making a school in Puniland?\NThat sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting... Language, math,\Nscience, and social studies?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're doing all sorts of classes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But can you really pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Puni School is In Session{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"Puni" in next time!
